    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44316" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐκρίν-εια</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῐ], ἡ, </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐκρῐνής</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>clear-sightedness</i>, <i><span class="en">
